<% content_for :title, "Contact" %>
<% content_for :description, "Get in touch with Grouparty: questions, bug reports, game ideas or privacy requests." %>

<div class="min-h-screen py-12 px-4 sm:px-6">
  <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-slate-300 leading-relaxed space-y-6">
    <%= render "pages/header", title: "Contact", subtitle: "Questions, ideas or problems? I'd love to hear from you." %>

    <div class="bg-slate-800 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 text-center">
      <p class="text-slate-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest font-semibold mb-3">Email</p>
      <%= mail_to PagesController::CONTACT_EMAIL, PagesController::CONTACT_EMAIL,
                  class: "text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 break-all" %>
      <p class="text-slate-500 text-sm mt-4">I usually answer within a few days.</p>
    </div>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">What you can write about</h2>
      <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
        <li><strong class="text-white">Bug reports:</strong> tell me which game, what happened, and the device and browser you used. A room code or a screenshot helps a lot.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Game ideas:</strong> many of the games started as suggestions. If you have one, send it.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Questions:</strong> how a game works, how to play with a big group, or anything else.</li>
        <li><strong class="text-white">Privacy requests:</strong> to ask about or delete data related to a room you played in, see the <%= link_to "Privacy Policy", privacy_path, class: "text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline" %>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="space-y-4">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white">About the developer</h2>
      <p>
        <%= SeoHelper::SITE_NAME %> is made by Daniel Arenas. You can also find me on
        <%= link_to "GitHub", PagesController::GITHUB_URL, class: "text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline", target: "_blank", rel: "noopener" %>.
        More about the project is on the <%= link_to "About page", about_path, class: "text-purple-400 hover:text-purple-300 underline" %>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</div>
